/S /H3
/T (Asia stands at an inflection point. The region processes more digital payments than anywhere else, hosts the world's most sophisticated super-apps, and serves as home to billions who need efficient cross-border financial solutions. Yet paradoxically, Asia remains underserved by the dollar-dominated stablecoin market. Local currencies like the Korean won, Japanese yen, and Indonesian rupiah power massive economies but barely register in the onchain world.)
/E (Asia stands at an inflection point. The region processes more digital payments than anywhere else, hosts the world's most sophisticated super-apps, and serves as home to billions who need efficient cross-border financial solutions. Yet paradoxically, Asia remains underserved by the dollar-dominated stablecoin market. Local currencies like the Korean won, Japanese yen, and Indonesian rupiah power massive economies but barely register in the onchain world.)
