/E (This conference confronted that paradox head-on. Speakers revealed live implementations: Korea's KRW1 launching that very week on Avalanche, Indonesia's regulatory sandbox achievements, Japan's solutions for enterprise transaction limits, the Philippines' integration with gaming ecosystems. These have gone from being experiments to production systems serving real users.)
