/T (Wu systematically addressed the barriers preventing traditional finance from embracing blockchain. He identified four core problems: bottlenecks when onboarding large order volumes, multi-day settlement times in traditional systems, friction losses during on-ramp and off-ramp processes, and compliance burdens including KYC requirements and regional trading restrictions. These challenges, he argued, have kept institutions from fully utilizing blockchain's potential.)
/E (Wu systematically addressed the barriers preventing traditional finance from embracing blockchain. He identified four core problems: bottlenecks when onboarding large order volumes, multi-day settlement times in traditional systems, friction losses during on-ramp and off-ramp processes, and compliance burdens including KYC requirements and regional trading restrictions. These challenges, he argued, have kept institutions from fully utilizing blockchain's potential.)
